# Project architecture

Canonical references:
- [Folder structure](mdc:docs/architecture/FOLDER_STRUCTURE.md)
- [Dependency rules](mdc:docs/architecture/DEPENDENCY_RULES.md)
- [Root AGENTS.md](mdc:AGENTS.md)

## Where things go

| Adding… | Folder |
|---|---|
| New URL / layout / handler | `src/app/**` |
| Shared primitive | `src/components/ui/` |
| Shared chrome | `src/components/layout/` |
| React provider | `src/components/providers/` |
| New product feature | `src/features/<name>/` |
| Pre-migration page tweak | `src/views/<name>/` (don't add new ones) |
| Shared hook (≥2 features) | `src/hooks/` |
| Browser-safe service / API client | `src/services/` |
| Shared Server Action | `src/actions/` |
| Shared type | `src/types/` |
| Shared Zod schema | `src/schemas/` |
| Prisma access | `src/server/db/`, `src/server/repositories/` |
| Server business logic | `src/server/services/` |
| Auth integration (server) | `src/server/auth/` |
| Security helper (server) | `src/server/security/` |
| Framework-agnostic util | `src/lib/<topic>/` |
| Validated config | `src/config/` |
| Shared constant | `src/constants/` |
| XML parse/serialize | `src/xml/` |
| Global CSS / tokens | `src/styles/` |
| Static image / font | `public/assets/**` |

## Hard rules

- **Server-only stays server-only.** `src/server/**` and
  `src/lib/env/server.ts` import `server-only`. Client code may not
  reach them.
- **New features go in `src/features/<name>/`.** Not in `views/`,
  `components/`, or `lib/`.
- **Shared folders must not import feature internals.**
- **No circular imports.**
- **Validate every external input** with Zod before use.
- **Preserve the UI.** Architectural moves must not alter rendered
  output.

## Checks before you say "done"

```
npm run typecheck
npm run lint
npm run build
```

If you add a folder, change a responsibility, change a boundary, or
touch a dependency rule — update
[`docs/architecture/FOLDER_STRUCTURE.md`](mdc:docs/architecture/FOLDER_STRUCTURE.md)
and the affected folder READMEs in the same change.
